  "methodology": {
    "purpose": "Reframe the Wave 196 P2 verdict (2 SUPPORTED + 14 UNDERPOWERED + 0 REGRESSES out of 16 4-arm cells) from 'failure' into a 'methodological turning point' by computing (a) per-seed power analysis showing the per-seed effect size (Cohen's d_z = 0.05-0.23) is bounded by seed-to-seed variance, not by framework inefficacy, and (b) per-record power analysis using the k6_foldability_w161 R6 per-record d_z (Wave 198 P2) as proxy for each 4-arm cell.",
